86729030525_4296724039851930444_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3z_ClJVNEP8Q7kNvwFxDcuk&_nc_oc=AdqeUjd5rqGrZkHJcXflqehVssKxesfRU1muijdIZup7m5I0AAlr5zbdjy2d7lB-Shc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO8SNOMN-pF7FSbKWwmf8IVocRIAjd8Ymt3PYK-hrtJNA&oe=6AE48B8A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_1771141017.png", "id": "1565774607979076", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_1565774611312409_8889675988640395872_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dk8KpB-2df0Q7kNvwGSNsA0&_nc_oc=AdpeeNTAEUr4kBexxbdEuCFvxZxP7cgD4KoAgiAyHmRH1v_X48m22IsBHnx3ymDJIiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMh04cndlz_kbL4a-o76r6B3oYxE4himJdlcR6Vc2aTIw&oe=6AE4AB61"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BeeJoy", "keywords": ["VRVideoPlayer", "3DVideoPlayer", "MVC3D", "SMB", "NAS"], "long_description": "BeeJoy is an advanced VR video player built for 3D movie enthusiasts, with support for MVC, SBS and OU playback, Blu-ray ISO/BDMV, NAS storage, and popular media servers.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n- **3D playback:** SBS, OU and MVC\n- **VR formats:** VR180 and VR360 video playback\n- **Blu-ray support:** Play ISO files and BDMV folders from local or network storage\n- **Network streaming:** SMB, WebDAV, FTP, SFTP and NFS\n- **Media servers:** Emby, Jellyfin, Plex and fnOS\n- **HDR video:** HDR and Dolby Vision on supported content and devices\n- **Immersive audio:** Dolby Atmos support\n- **Advanced controls:** Extensive video, audio, subtitle and playback options\n\nWhether you're watching standard videos, Blu-ray 3D movies, VR180/360 content, or media stored on your NAS, BeeJoy delivers a flexible and immersive viewing experience built for Meta Quest.\n\nMore features and improvements are continuously being added.", "short_description": "Advanced VR video player for 3D/MVC, Blu-ray ISO/BDMV, NAS and network streaming."}]}, "developer_name": null, "deve